  "reviewed_facts": [
    "PolicyName is required, precision60; Description precision240",
    "Warning and error tolerance must be nonnegative and warning strictly below error whenever both are nonnull",
    "Parent AltKey is PolicyName; line AltKey includes owning policy,currency,end date,geography,role,start date,type and zone",
    "Import service resolves both AltKeys, calls MigratorHelper.readXML and commits only at root",
    "Migration getter is derived from root service definition; it does not read the transient default",
    "Child currency inheritance is suppressed in migration mode",
    "Pinned shared CSV/XML and ADF implementation is located and hash-bound. Empty included scalars serialize explicit null; absent XML children are distinct.",
    "CarRentalPolicyEOImpl.create SINGLE/VIOLATION defaults are not used: consumer-owned SINGLE and explicit user enforcement choice are serialized after creation.",
    "Audit VO fields are non-updateable; status and disabled determinant values are explicit consumer-managed create scope, not inferred platform defaults."
  ],
