    "No key renames, date/currency/status transitions or determinant conversion",
    "Blank update cells preserve retained fields; this does not establish shared XML null handling",
    "DRAFT/VALID policies and rates only; preserve status on update; selected resulting schedules must have compatible identities and nonoverlapping periods",
    "DailyLimit presence and finite nonnegative amount are local input/UI-profile checks; not claimed as a demonstrated EO validator"
  ],
